---
source: tests/golden/harness.rs
---
  x `name` takes no argument
   ,-[tests/repos/broken-image/image.kdl:4:5]
 3 | image "Not An Id" {
 4 |     name "Broken Image"
   :     ^^|^
   :       `-- a path segment
 5 | }
   `----
  help: the os-release fields are options of the `os-release` component; list
        `os-release` in the image and set `name` in its block

  x invalid image id `Not An Id`
   ,-[tests/repos/broken-image/image.kdl:3:1]
 2 | 
 3 | image "Not An Id" {
   : ^^|^^
   :   `-- must be lowercase letters, digits and dashes, starting with a letter
 4 |     name "Broken Image"
   `----
  help: it becomes an image tag and a cache tag, both of which restrict it

  x `Not An Id` lists no base
   ,-[tests/repos/broken-image/image.kdl:3:1]
 2 | 
 3 | image "Not An Id" {
   : ^^|^^
   :   `-- nothing to build on
 4 |     name "Broken Image"
   `----
  help: list a base component, such as `base-image { fedora-bootc { version
        "44" } }`, or define one inline with `base "<image reference>"`
